516
00:28:56,000 --> 00:28:57,780
And there's where a double rifle excels.

517
00:29:02,160 --> 00:29:04,000
At the end of the 19th century,

518
00:29:04,001 --> 00:29:07,200
one of the most fearsome hunting weapons was formally introduced,

519
00:29:08,280 --> 00:29:10,560
the 98 Mauser bolt-action rifle.

