525
00:29:28,040 --> 00:29:30,480
The 98 Mauser had a bolt handle,

526
00:29:30,700 --> 00:29:32,960
which when pushed in and down,

527
00:29:32,961 --> 00:29:35,360
locked a fresh cartridge into the chamber,

528
00:29:36,060 --> 00:29:38,440
hermetically sealing the ammunition and its gases.

529
00:29:39,140 --> 00:29:42,240
The locking system allowed for more lethal and powerful cartridges.

530
00:29:42,900 --> 00:29:44,820
It's a model still in wide use today.

531
00:29:48,620 --> 00:29:52,220
But the rampant use of these gruesomely effective new guns,

532
00:29:52,221 --> 00:29:55,520
along with human population growth, commercial hunting,

533
00:29:56,060 --> 00:29:57,740
