539
00:30:13,800 --> 00:30:15,800
And what he would do is literally get on a train

540
00:30:15,900 --> 00:30:18,000
through his Austro-Hungarian empire,

541
00:30:18,100 --> 00:30:20,180
ride on the train with loaders on either side of them,

542
00:30:20,280 --> 00:30:22,420
and literally shoot everything he could see.

543
00:30:22,520 --> 00:30:24,420
And following his train was another train

